00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.240
Now, you might be
thinking, that sounds great

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:20.260
but I'm working with legacy
systems, user stores that

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:24.400
already have existing users,
and other databases that

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:26.200
fit my company's needs.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:28.480
How do I integrate
those with Firebase?

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:32.420
Or maybe I have ML models
